{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act33side_level_act33side_st01",
  "groupId": "act33side",
  "stageId": "act33side_st01",
  "title": "未完成的告別",
  "storyCode": "BB-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1fc3c3bff3e12d4e9b6e0424e1286442a464b8e8b7e779e32b6e2b42dc2d36f6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男孩在夢中哭泣，女孩將男孩裹在自己抵擋風雪的斗篷中，為他拭去了眼淚。\n冰冷。斷續。呼嘯。\n巨人輕輕講述一部遙遠的史詩……\n她的聲音穿越了風雪的裂隙。\n眾魂的呼喚為其和音，男孩的嗚咽敲打著節拍。\n女孩在夢中的酷寒中微微喘息，她捂住了男孩的眼睛，然後閉上了眼。\n千年前的歌謠仍在他們眼前演繹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“這就是此章的結尾。”\n巨人淡入了夢中的風雪中，將孩子拋棄在身後。\n男孩漸漸不再聽到自己啼哭的聲音。\n他醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1094年夏\n卡茲戴爾地區，荒廢小鎮外"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這就是此章的結尾，阿斯卡綸。我的故事說完了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這是我的族人……獨眼巨人深入北境前，最後望向卡茲戴爾的所見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這一章是已然逝去的未知歷史，是尚未臨近的可能未來，抑或是毫無意義的囈語？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "近千年來，無人知曉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "直到他們出現，命運的湍流開始岔進更窄、更確定的河道……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "現在，她所見的命運，已經近在眼前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "text": "我不關心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "咳，難得你有耐心聽我說完。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "紅色的鮮血慢慢沿著他的面具下沿滑落到了他的胸口。\n阿斯卡綸微微眯眼，他已走投無路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "text": "你會死，所以我給你最後的尊重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "咳。呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "從我們認識開始，你從未把那些個預言放在心上，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "那……你永遠不會理解一個貪婪的人對控制命運的渴望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "text": "死前少廢話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "我知道你急著去和巴別塔那些人會合，但現在還沒到你走的時候。你看，天災快到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "啊……我倒開始好奇了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "你在風暴之中，找到了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "text": "讓開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "委託必須完成，這是我自己在疤痕商場定下的規矩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "無論生——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯卡綸的身形在他的背後消失，同一時間，薄暮般的霧氣已經繞緊巨人的脖頸，將他的身軀高懸於危崖之外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "text": "那你有看到過自己的結局嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "……我不在乎預言，和你一樣，哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "但事實就是，我們都逃不開命運。你不想掙扎嗎？憑什麼？為什麼？怎麼能夠？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "不要忘了，預言中也有你的一席之地——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嗚咽。風暴。\n哀婉的吟唱在他們的耳畔響起，來自女妖河谷的輓歌掠過地平，捲入風暴中央。\n阿斯卡綸的身體不由自主地戰慄著，她渾身冰涼。\n一陣無法訴說的刺痛從她的耳後一路激盪到腳底。\n沒有名字的輓歌，不祥的預兆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "別了……卡茲戴爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯卡綸聽到了一聲嘆息。\n她的手越握越緊，直到“疤眼”的喉嚨無法發出一絲輕微的聲音。\n然後，她鬆開了手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“疤眼”",
      "text": "……哈，該死的命運。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眨眼間，獨眼巨人的巨大身體成了懸崖下一個渺小的點。\n薄霧在狂風中散去，連同兜帽投下的陰影一起，消失在墜落懸崖的淚水中。\n喘息聲，天災雲中低沉的雷鳴，風沙席捲荒地的呼嘯……\n萬物的聲音歸於沉寂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "維多利亞，倫蒂尼姆"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "那麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "屬於她的薩卡茲，抬起頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "如果你們還要履行她交予的使命，我就站在這裡，等你們上前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "我准許你們為她復仇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺殺者",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺殺者",
      "text": "我的衣服上，繡了我的名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺殺者",
      "text": "是特蕾西婭殿下親自刺繡的，而它此刻正微微發燙，我知道……這意味著什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺殺者",
      "text": "特蕾西婭殿下交給我們的任務已經結束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺殺者",
      "text": "我們不再向你舉劍。薩卡茲不會在外敵前刀劍相向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺殺者",
      "text": "……我們，向你效忠，攝政王。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺殺者",
      "text": "只要你仍然抱有對薩卡茲的熱忱，我們便甘願把性命交給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "即使你們險些毀掉了我們在維多利亞的一切布置？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺殺者",
      "text": "如果軍事委員會決定讓我們死，我們可以死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺殺者",
      "text": "只要這能帶來更好的結果……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺殺者",
      "text": "那便如她所願。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "你們方才還是險些葬送計劃的叛黨頭目，讓我怎麼相信——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "曼弗雷德。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "“如她所願”，是嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "你的名字，劊子手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刺殺者",
      "text": "尤莉葉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "我會記住你的名字，也會交給你最後的任務。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "衛兵，刺客，傭兵，這場血戰的每一位倖存者——我要你們踏入諸王長眠之所。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "我要你們拆碎維多利亞的鋼鐵心臟，在那裡伏擊並剿滅所有的蒸汽騎士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "text": "這是軍事委員會削弱倫蒂尼姆的核心計劃，讓我們也參與？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "曼弗雷德會看好你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "text": "我們是不是，不可能活著離開那裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "大可去爭取。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "……還有什麼事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "text": "只是看看，是什麼樣的人培養出了阿斯卡綸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "text": "她始終沒有擺脫你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特雷西斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "text": "……在我發誓追隨特蕾西婭殿下時，從未想過那一對改寫了卡茲戴爾歷史的混血雙子的故事會如此落幕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "text": "更沒想到，原來我這種賤命胚子，也在這段故事之中有了一席之地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "text": "永別了，特雷西斯殿下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "text": "我會把對你的憎恨，帶進墳墓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡茲戴爾地區，巴別塔羅德島本艦"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "自誕生於世的那一天起，凱爾希從未感到這道長廊如此漫長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "Mon3tr！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "text": "（憤怒的嘶吼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無名的刺客",
      "text": "咳咳，咳哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無名的刺客",
      "text": "勛爵……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無名的刺客",
      "text": "不要安葬我們，卡茲戴爾的土地再不能容下更多叛徒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "了結他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "阿米婭！博士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "text": "（焦急的嘶鳴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "系統無回應……這……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "Mon3tr，切開門！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "text": "（狂暴的嘶吼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "Mon3tr，熔毀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不朽的帝國化為齏粉，神民的權杖在先民的呐喊中被折為兩段，天幕上浪湧般的脈衝，群星自璀璨閃耀到暗淡解體的不變規律……\n消亡，新生，萬物輪迴，於她從不陌生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "text": "（興奮的嘶吼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "特蕾西婭——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凱爾希下意識地搜索腦海中的記憶……\n消亡，新生，萬物輪迴。\n不。\n這一次，不一樣。不太一樣。\n她第一次，必須與第一位能與她平等交流的摯友告別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "特蕾西婭……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "text": "阿米婭……博士……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
